ally important making a family and  wondering if because switch gears a bit  and talk a bit about your personal life  who are the people in your life that  have inspired your sense of self and  confidence you know I have I'm fortunate  to have really had a few so it's  interesting my mom got married when she  was 18 she couldn't finish high school  because her mother got very sick my dad  was 22 when they got married and he  didn't he was in the Armed Services and  she tried for 1012 years couldn't have  children and finally when she was 30 my  dad worked nights in the produce  business and his boss who he worked for  gave my parents the money so they could  adopt me and so from the time I was like  little you know I always remember my mom  saying you were special you can do  anything you want and I felt part  responsibility you know I was kind of a  little serious you know I guess when I  was younger to prove I could you but  there was one thing my mother always  said to me that has stayed with me my  whole life and it probably annoyed me  sometimes at the time which it probably  does my daughter now but when something  would happen whether it was good or  whether it was bad if a boyfriend broke  up with me or something could happen and  I was complaining or I was excited she  said Mindy everything in life is be  shared means it's meant to be and what  it's made me do is I never look  backwards I only look forward because  it's like that movie sliding doors he  knows what could happen  that bad thing didn't happen you know  what what what else could have been  behind that door which is why I believe  I'm an optimist you know I've been  quoted as I only hire tickers I don't  hire yours  I'm not very good at negative energy but  it's that everything in life is meant to  be and I really embrace that so that's  probably from a personal perspective and  then I think from a business perspective  there's definitely been a few things  working for Ralph Lauren you really yo